# Class: obo:PROMOT_0032012 (Fatigabilité de la musculature faciale)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(obo:IAO_0000119 "HP:0003473") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:PROMOT_0032012 "A type of weakness of the facial musculature (i.e. one or more muscles innervated by the seventh cranial nerve) that occurs after a muscle group is used and lessens if the muscle group has some rest. That is, there is diminution of the strength of the facial musculature with repetitive muscle actions."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:PROMOT_0032012 "Une faiblesse de la musculature faciale, c.à.d. d’un ou plusieurs muscles inervés par le septième nerf cranial, qui se manifeste quand un groupe musculaire facial est sollicité et qui diminue après que le groupe en question a été mis au repos. En résumé, il s’agit d’une diminution de la force des muscles faciaux à la suite d’une sollicitation répêtée."@fr)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:PROMOT_0032012 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:PROMOT_1000001 obo:PROMOT_0032012 "Congenital myasthenic syndrom Scoping review")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:PROMOT_1000001 obo:PROMOT_0032012 "Congenital myopathy Scoping review")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:PROMOT_0032012 "Debilidad fatigable de la musculatura facial"@es)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:PROMOT_0032012 "Fatigabilité de la musculature faciale"@fr)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:PROMOT_0032012 "Fatiguable weakness of facial musculature"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:PROMOT_0032012 obo:HP_0003473)

# Class: obo:PROMOT_0032013 (Fatiguable weakness of the ocular muscles)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(obo:IAO_0000119 "HP:0003473") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:PROMOT_0032013 "A type of weakness of the ocular muscles that occurs after a muscle group is used and lessens if the muscle group has some rest. That is, there is diminution of the strength of the ocular muscles with repetitive muscle actions."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:PROMOT_0032013 "Une faiblesse des muscles occulaires qui se manifeste quand un groupe musculaire occulaire est sollicité et qui diminue après que le groupe en question a été mis au repos. En résumé, il s’agit d’une diminution de la force des muscles occulaires à la suite d’une sollicitation répêtée."@fr)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:PROMOT_0032013 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:PROMOT_1000001 obo:PROMOT_0032013 "Congenital myasthenic syndrom Scoping review")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:PROMOT_1000001 obo:PROMOT_0032013 "Congenital myopathy Scoping review")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:PROMOT_0032013 "Debilidad fatigable de los músculos oculares"@es)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:PROMOT_0032013 "Fatigabilité des muscles occulaires"@fr)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:PROMOT_0032013 "Fatiguable weakness of the ocular muscles"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:PROMOT_0032013 obo:HP_0003473)

# Class: obo:PROMOT_0032014 (Fatigabilité des muscles axiaux)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(obo:IAO_0000119 "HP:0003473") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:PROMOT_0032014 "A type of weakness of the axial muscles (i.e., of the muscles of the head and neck, spine, and ribs) that occurs after a muscle group is used and lessens if the muscle group has some rest. That is, there is diminution of the strength of the axial muscles with repetitive muscle actions."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:PROMOT_0032014 "Une faiblesse des muscles axiaux, c.à.d. des muscles de la tête et du coup, de la colonne vertébrale et des côtes, qui se manifeste quand un groupe musculaire axial est sollicité et qui diminue après que le groupe en question a été mis au repos. En résumé, il s’agit d’une diminution de la force des muscles axiaux à la suite d’une sollicitation répêtée."@fr)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:PROMOT_0032014 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:PROMOT_1000001 obo:PROMOT_0032014 "Congenital myasthenic syndrom Scoping review")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:PROMOT_1000001 obo:PROMOT_0032014 "Congenital myopathy Scoping review")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:PROMOT_0032014 "Debilidad fatigable muscular axial"@es)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:PROMOT_0032014 "Fatigabilité des muscles axiaux"@fr)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:PROMOT_0032014 "Fatiguable weakness of axial muscles"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:PROMOT_0032014 obo:HP_0003473)

